<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Oct industrial output up 9.9 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Oct industrial output up 9.9 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia's Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     Oct	 Sept	Oct95</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (pct)		3.1	 29.5	-1.4</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (pct)		  9.9	  5.0	-0.1</p>
<p>    Index (base 1995)		 111.3	108.0     101.3</p>
<p>--Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386 61 1263 644</p>
</text>
